# Generated computation data/cache: resolution tables, generator/map dumps, phi
# caches, etc. -- regenerated by running the tools (motTab/e2p/yoneda2/...), not
# source. Matches the "<maxdeg>_<name>" / "<maxdeg>_back<N>" / "back<N>" naming
# convention used throughout (e.g. 40_gens, 40_yoneda2_6_9_phi3, back12).
/[0-9]*_*
/back[0-9]*
